# Task Completion Checklist

Every refactoring task MUST deliver these artifacts before marking complete.

## 1. Change Summary

Provide a concise summary:

```markdown
### Files Changed
- lib/module-a.mjs: extracted X from mosa-runtime
- lib/module-b.mjs: renamed from old-name.js
- lib/_archive_YYYY-MM-DD/: archived 5 obsolete files

### Lines Changed
- Added: ~50 lines
- Removed: ~80 lines (moved to archive)
- Modified: ~20 lines
```

## 2. File Listing

List ALL affected files:

```bash
# NEW files created
ls -1 lib/new-*.mjs

# MOVED files (from → to)
lib/old.js → lib/_archive_2026-08-11/old.js

# MODIFIED files
lib/mosa-runtime.mjs (468 → 250 lines)
```

## 3. Archive Manifest

If files were archived, provide `lib/_archive_YYYY-MM-DD/README.md`:

```markdown
# Files Archived on 2026-08-11

## Reason
These files were replaced by the new module system.

## Files
- old-module.js: Replaced by lib/new-module.mjs
- unused.d.ts: No longer generated with .mjs migration

## Rollback
To restore: `mv lib/_archive_2026-08-11/* lib/`
```

## 4. Test Results

Run and paste output of ALL four commands:

```bash
npm test          # ✅ Must show ≥918 passing
npm run check     # ✅ Must show "Syntax checked N files"
npm run lint      # ✅ Must show 0 errors
npm run audit     # ✅ Must show "found 0 vulnerabilities"
```

**Format:**
```
✅ npm test: 918/921 passing (1 pre-existing failure)
✅ npm run check: Syntax checked 145 files
✅ npm run lint: 0 errors
✅ npm run audit: 0 vulnerabilities
```

## 5. Git Status

Provide `git status` output:

```bash
git status --short
```

Expected format:
```
M  lib/mosa-runtime.mjs
A  lib/new-module.mjs
D  lib/old-module.js
```

## 6. Commit Message

Draft a commit message following project style:

```
refactor: unify lib/ file identity to .mjs

- Archived 18 .ts source files to _archive_2026-08-11/
- Verified .js/.d.ts/.js.map no longer imported
- Confirmed lib/ now uses .mjs exclusively
- All 918 tests still passing

Ref: Day 1 Task A (refactor-boundaries.mdc)
```

**Rules:**
- First line: < 70 characters
- Body: What changed and why
- Reference: Which day/task this completes

## 7. Diff Sample

For large changes, provide a sample diff:

```bash
git diff lib/mosa-runtime.mjs | head -50
```

## Verification Checklist

Before submitting, confirm:

- [ ] All 6 sections above completed
- [ ] No files deleted with `rm -rf` (all moved to archive)
- [ ] All 4 test commands passing
- [ ] No new ESLint errors introduced
- [ ] No user-facing behavior changed
- [ ] No dependencies modified
- [ ] Archive README.md exists if files were moved
- [ ] Commit message follows project style

## What Happens Next

After you submit, the coordinator will:

1. Review your deliverables against this checklist
2. Run the 4 test commands independently
3. Check for red-line violations (refactor-boundaries.mdc)
4. Either **approve** (→ Day N+1) or **request fixes** (→ revise Day N)

